  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The two sets of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> parallel lines along with two sets of two parallel lines of the given parallelogram will form two sets of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> parallel lines. Each parallelogram is formed by choosing two parallel lines from each of the above</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Total number of parallelograms</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, option (c) is correct.</p>",
